msgstr ""
"For the everyday drink take Core: it is cheaper than most specialty and "
"stable from batch to batch. Leave microlots for the guest slot — it both "
"sells and justifies the price."

#: page-wholesale.php:61
msgid "«Профіль пливе від партії до партії»"
msgstr "“The profile drifts from batch to batch”"

#: page-wholesale.php:62
msgid ""
